WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
Here is one whole pizza. Let us split it into equal shares.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:12.500
Two equal pieces make the whole pizza. One of those two pieces is one half.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:19.800
Now split the same whole into four equal pieces. One of those four pieces is one quarter.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:27.800
Select two quarters. Together they cover the same amount as one half. Two fourths equals one half.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:33.850
Your turn. How many quarters make one whole pizza? Pause and explain how you know.
